  "definitions": {
    "ControlSmartLiveRsp": {
      "properties": {
        "command_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "控制命令ID",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "command": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "命令名称。\n- INSERT_PLAY_SCRIPT:插入表演脚本。用于互动回复。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:ShootScript。\n- REWRITE_PLAY_SCRIPT:动态编辑未播放剧本。params结构定义:scene_scripts。\n- INSERT_PLAY_AUDIO:插入驱动音频。用于音频直接驱动。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:PlayAudioInfo。\n- GET_CURRENT_PLAYING_SCRIPTS:查询本轮剧本列表。响应为LivePlayingScriptList结构。\n- REFRESH_OUTPUT_URL:更新当前任务的rtmp推流信息。params结构定义: RefreshOutputUrlConfig。\n- REWRITE_INTERACTION_RULES:动态修改互动规则。params结构定义:interaction_rules。\n- GET_LIVE_JOB_CONFIG_INFO:获取任务中的房间信息。params结构定义:SmartLiveRoomInfo。\n- CLEAN_UP_INSERT_COMMAND:清理未播放的插入命令。params结构定义:[CleanUpInsertCommand](metastudio_02_0014.xml)\n- RESET_EXIT_CONFIG: 重置退出参数。params结构定义:LiveExitConfig",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64,
          "enum": [
            "INSERT_PLAY_SCRIPT",
            "REWRITE_PLAY_SCRIPT",
            "INSERT_PLAY_AUDIO",
            "GET_CURRENT_PLAYING_SCRIPTS",
            "REFRESH_OUTPUT_URL",
            "REWRITE_INTERACTION_RULES",
            "GET_LIVE_JOB_CONFIG_INFO",
            "CLEAN_UP_INSERT_COMMAND",
            "RESET_EXIT_CONFIG"
          ]
        },
        "result": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "命令执行结果",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 1048576
        }
      },
      "description": "直播控制响应,根据具体命令请求,需要进行不同解析"
    },
    "ReviewConfig": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "no_need_review": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "免审核。 目前仅白名单用户可使用此参数,非白名单用户跟随系统策略审核。"
        }
      },
      "description": "内容审核配置"
    },
    "ControlSmartLiveReq": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "command"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "command": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n命令名称。\n**约束限制**:\n不限制\n**取值范围**:\n* INSERT_PLAY_SCRIPT:插入表演脚本。用于互动回复。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:[PlayTextInfo](metastudio_02_0014.xml)。\n* INSERT_PLAY_AUDIO:插入驱动音频。用于音频直接驱动。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:[PlayAudioInfo](metastudio_02_0014.xml)。\n* REWRITE_PLAY_SCRIPT:动态编辑未播放剧本。params结构定义:[scene_scripts](CreateSmartLiveRoom.xml)。\n* REWRITE_INTERACTION_RULES:动态修改互动规则。params结构定义:[interaction_rules](CreateSmartLiveRoom.xml)。\n* GET_CURRENT_PLAYING_SCRIPTS:查询本轮剧本列表。响应为:[LivePlayingScriptList](metastudio_02_0014.xml)结构。\n* SHOW_LAYER:显示导播素材,用于直播导播。params结构定义:LiveGuideRuleInfo。\n* REFRESH_OUTPUT_URL:更新当前任务的rtmp推流信息。params结构定义: RefreshOutputUrlConfig。\n* GET_LIVE_JOB_CONFIG_INFO:获取任务中的房间信息。params结构定义:与[直播间详情响应体](ShowSmartLiveRoom.xml)一致。\n* CLEAN_UP_INSERT_COMMAND:清理未播放的插入命令。params结构定义:[CleanUpInsertCommand](metastudio_02_0014.xml)\n* RESET_EXIT_CONFIG: 重置退出参数。params结构定义 LiveExitConfig。例:{\"command\":\"RESET_EXIT_CONFIG\",\"params\":{\"max_live_duration\":168,\"auto_stop_mode\":\"FORCE_EXIT\",\"max_exception_waiting_duration\":60}}\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64,
          "enum": [
            "INSERT_PLAY_SCRIPT",
            "REWRITE_PLAY_SCRIPT",
            "INSERT_PLAY_AUDIO",
            "REWRITE_INTERACTION_RULES",
            "GET_CURRENT_PLAYING_SCRIPTS",
            "REFRESH_OUTPUT_URL",
            "GET_LIVE_JOB_CONFIG_INFO",
            "CLEAN_UP_INSERT_COMMAND",
            "RESET_EXIT_CONFIG"
          ]
        },
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n命令参数。\n**约束限制**:\n不限制\n**取值范围**:\n参考COMMNAD说明。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
          "properties": {}
        },
        "review_config": {
          "description": "内容审核配置",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ReviewConfig"
        }
      },
      "description": "控制命令。"
    }
  },
